{"id":"code-lru-cache","title":"LRU cache","category":"code","difficulty":3,"prompt":"Write a Python class `LRUCache` with:\n\n- `__init__(self, capacity: int)`: capacity is at least 1.\n- `get(self, key)`: return the value for `key`, or -1 if it is absent. A hit makes the key\n  the most recently used.\n- `put(self, key, value)`: insert or update. Updating an existing key also makes it the\n  most recently used and never evicts anything. Inserting a new key into a full cache\n  first evicts the least recently used key.\n\nBoth operations should run in O(1) time on average.","system":"You are completing one task from an evaluation suite. Do the task as asked.\n\nReply with one Python code block that defines exactly what the task asks for. Use only the standard library. Do not include tests, examples, or print statements.","grader":{"type":"code","entrypoint":"LRUCache","tests":["c = LRUCache(2); c.put(1, 1); c.put(2, 2); assert c.get(1) == 1 and c.get(2) == 2 and c.get(3) == -1","c = LRUCache(2); c.put(1, 1); c.put(2, 2); c.put(3, 3); assert c.get(1) == -1 and c.get(2) == 2 and c.get(3) == 3","c = LRUCache(2); c.put(1, 1); c.put(2, 2); c.get(1); c.put(3, 3); assert c.get(1) == 1 and c.get(2) == -1","c = LRUCache(2); c.put(1, 1); c.put(2, 2); c.put(1, 10); c.put(3, 3); assert c.get(1) == 10 and c.get(2) == -1","c = LRUCache(2); c.put(1, 1); c.put(2, 2); c.put(2, 20); assert c.get(1) == 1 and c.get(2) == 20","c = LRUCache(1); c.put(\"a\", 1); c.put(\"b\", 2); assert c.get(\"a\") == -1 and c.get(\"b\") == 2"]},"reference":"```python\nfrom collections import OrderedDict\n\nclass LRUCache:\n    def __init__(self, capacity: int):\n        self.capacity = capacity\n        self.items: OrderedDict = OrderedDict()\n\n    def get(self, key):\n        if key not in self.items:\n            return -1\n        self.items.move_to_end(key)\n        return self.items[key]\n\n    def put(self, key, value):\n        if key in self.items:\n            self.items.move_to_end(key)\n        elif len(self.items) >= self.capacity:\n            self.items.popitem(last=False)\n        self.items[key] = value\n```","answers":["```python\nfrom collections import OrderedDict\n\nclass LRUCache:\n    def __init__(self, capacity: int):\n        self.capacity = capacity\n        self.items: OrderedDict = OrderedDict()\n\n    def get(self, key):\n        if key not in self.items:\n            return -1\n        self.items.move_to_end(key)\n        return self.items[key]\n\n    def put(self, key, value):\n        if key in self.items:\n            self.items.move_to_end(key)\n        elif len(self.items) >= self.capacity:\n            self.items.popitem(last=False)\n        self.items[key] = value\n```","```python\nclass LRUCache:\n    def __init__(self, capacity: int):\n        self.capacity = capacity\n        self.items = {}\n\n    def get(self, key):\n        return self.items.get(key, -1)\n\n    def put(self, key, value):\n        if key not in self.items and len(self.items) >= self.capacity:\n            oldest = next(iter(self.items))\n            del self.items[oldest]\n        self.items[key] = value\n```"],"cells":[{"arm":"haiku-low","trial":0,"mode":"batch","status":"ok","score":1.0,"passed":true,"answer":0,"details":{"passed":6,"total":6,"tests":[{"ok":true},{"ok":true},{"ok":true},{"ok":true},{"ok":true},{"ok":true}],"simulated":{"pass_probability":0.551,"answer":"reference"}},"input_tokens":219,"output_tokens":276,"cost_usd":0.0001599,"latency_ms":null},{"arm":"haiku-low","trial":1,"mode":"batch","status":"ok","score":1.0,"passed":true,"answer":0,"details":{"passed":6,"total":6,"tests":[{"ok":true},{"ok":true},{"ok":true},{"ok":true},{"ok":true},{"ok":true}],"simulated":{"pass_probability":0.551,"answer":"reference"}},"input_tokens":219,"output_tokens":427,"cost_usd":0.0002354,"latency_ms":null},{"arm":"haiku-low","trial":2,"mode":"batch","status":"ok","score":1.0,"passed":true,"answer":0,"details":{"passed":6,"total":6,"tests":[{"ok":true},{"ok":